#This is a sample file used to define the OntoGPT templates offered by the tool,
#using 3 columns tab separated (longer whitespace are TAB characters):
#
#<value>	<name>	<description>
#
#value: Template file stem in ontogpt/templates (NOT the id printed by `ontogpt list-templates`)
#name: Display name shown to users
#description: Short description
#
#Examples:
#
#environmental_sample	Environmental sample	Environmental sample metadata
#environmental-metadata	Environmental metadata	Environmental metadata of a sample
#metagenome	Metagenome study	Metagenome study description
#adverse_outcome_pathway	Adverse outcome pathway	Adverse outcome pathway (AOP)
#ctd	CTD	Chemical-disease relationships
#biotic_interaction	Biotic interaction	Interactions between organisms
#reaction	Reaction	Chemical reactions
